   "en": "In the era of \"salt damage\" when salt fills the city. Mana, who lives in Tokyo on the verge of collapse, picks up a collapsing young man, Ryoichi, carrying a large bag on his back. Together with Akiba, a man who acts like her guardian, she heads for Ryoichi's destination, the sea, but...?\nA complete comicalization of Hiro Arikawa's timeless masterpiece! The supreme entertainment opening presented by the same author-artist duo behind \"Library War LOVE \u0026 WAR\"!"
